hadiths[33]{hadithnumber,text}:
"923","Ali bin Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya bin Saeed ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Hamid bin Jafar ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Hakeem bin Aflah se, woh Ibn Masood se, woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Musalman ka Musalman par char haq hain: jab woh beemar ho to us ki ayadat kare, jab woh faut ho jaye to us ke paas hazir ho, jab woh use bulaye to us ki baat qabool kare, aur jab use cheenk aaye to use Yarhamukallah kahe."
"924","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abul Ahwas ne hamein khabar di, Ashas se, woh Muawiya bin Suwaid se, woh Bara bin Azib se, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne saat cheezon ka hukm diya aur saat cheezon se mana farmaya: hamein mareez ki ayadat ka, janazon ke peeche jane ka, cheenkne wale ko Yarhamukallah kehne ka, qasam khane wale ki qasam poori karne ka, mazloom ki madad karne ka, salam ko phailane ka, aur bulane wale ki dawat qabool karne ka hukm diya. Aur hamein sone ki anguthiyon se, chandi ke bartanon se, mayasir se, qassi se, istabraq se, deebaj se aur resham se mana farmaya."
"925","Aur Ismail bin Jafar se, woh Ala bin Abdur Rahman se, woh apne walid se, woh Abu Huraira se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Musalman ka Musalman par che haq hain, kaha gaya: Ya Rasoolullah woh kya hain, Aap ne farmaya: jab tum us se milo to use salam kaho, jab woh tumhein bulaye to use jawab do, jab woh tum se naseehat talab kare to use naseehat karo, jab use cheenk aaye aur woh Allah ki hamd bayan kare to use Yarhamukallah kaho, jab woh beemar ho to us ki ayadat karo, aur jab woh faut ho jaye to us ke peeche jao."
"926","Talq bin Ghannam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shaiban ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, woh Khaisama se, woh Hazrat Ali raziyallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Jo shakhs kisi suni hui cheenk ke waqt ye kahe Alhamdulillahi Rabbil Alameen ala kulli haal ma kana, to woh kabhi daadh aur kaan ke dard ko nahi payega."
"927","Malik bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Aziz bin Abi Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Dinar ne hamein khabar di, Abu Salih se, woh Abu Huraira se, woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ko cheenk aaye to use Alhamdulillah kehna chahiye, phir jab woh Alhamdulillah kahe to us ka bhai ya us ka saathi use Yarhamukallah kahe, aur woh khud kahe Yahdikumullah wa Yuslih Balakum."
"928","Asim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zib ne hum se bayan kiya, Saeed Maqburi se, woh apne walid se, woh Abu Huraira se, woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah cheenk ko pasand farmata hai aur jamai ko napasand farmata hai, aur jab tum mein se koi cheenke aur Allah ki hamd bayan kare to har us Musalman par jo use sune haq hai ke woh Yarhamukallah kahe. Aur rahi jamai to woh shaitan ki taraf se hai, pas jab tum mein se koi jamai le to jahan tak ho sake use roke, kyunke jab tum mein se koi jamai leta hai to shaitan us par hansta hai."
"929","Hamid bin Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awana ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Jamra se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Ibn Abbas ko kehte hue suna jab unhein cheenk ka jawab diya jata: Afanallahu wa iyyakum minan naar yarhamukumullah."
"930","Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yala ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu Munain jo Yazeed bin Kaisan hain ne hamein khabar di, Abu Hazim se, woh Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas baithe hue the to ek aadmi ko cheenk aayi to us ne Allah ki hamd bayan ki to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne us se farmaya Yarhamukallah, phir doosre ko cheenk aayi to Aap ne us se kuch na kaha to us ne kaha Ya Rasoolullah Aap ne doosre ko jawab diya aur mujh se kuch na kaha, Aap ne farmaya Beshak us ne Allah ki hamd bayan ki aur tum khamosh rahe."
"931","Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman Taimi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Anas ko kehte hue suna: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas do aadmiyon ko cheenk aayi to Aap ne ek ko tashmeet kaha aur doosre ko tashmeet na kaha to us ne kaha Aap ne is ko tashmeet kaha aur mujhe tashmeet na kaha, Aap ne farmaya Beshak is ne Allah ki hamd bayan ki aur tum ne us ki hamd bayan na ki."
"932","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ribi bin Ibrahim jo Ibn Ulaiyya ke bhai hain ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman bin Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Saeed bin Abi Saeed se, woh Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas do aadmi baithe un mein se ek doosre se zyada shareef tha, to un mein se shareef ko cheenk aayi to us ne Allah ki hamd bayan na ki aur Aap ne us ko tashmeet na kaha, aur doosre ko cheenk aayi to us ne Allah ki hamd bayan ki to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne us ko tashmeet kaha, to shareef ne kaha Maine aap ke paas cheenka to aap ne mujhe tashmeet na kaha aur is doosre ko cheenk aayi to aap ne use tashmeet kaha, to Aap ne farmaya Beshak is ne Allah ko yaad kiya to maine use yaad kiya aur tum Allah ko bhool gaye to main tumhein bhool gaya."
"933","Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Malik se, woh Nafe se, woh Abdullah bin Umar se ke woh jab cheenkte aur un se Yarhamukallah kaha jata to woh kehte Yarhamunallahu wa iyyakum wa yaghfiru lana wa lakum."
"934","Abu Nuaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata se, woh Abu Abdur Rahman se, woh Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Jab tum mein se kisi ko cheenk aaye to use Alhamdulillahi Rabbil Alameen kehna chahiye, aur jo jawab de use Yarhamukallah kehna chahiye, aur woh khud kahe Yaghfirullahu li wa lakum."
"935","Aasim bin Ali ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ikrima ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Iyas bin Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas ek shakhs ko chheenk aayi to unhon ne kaha: Allah tum par reham kare, phir us ne doosri martaba chheenk maari to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: ye zukam wala hai."
"936","Aarim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umara bin Zaazaan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mahkool Azdi ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main Ibn Umar ke pehlu mein tha, pas masjid ki taraf se ek shakhs ko chheenk aayi to Ibn Umar ne kaha: Allah tum par reham kare agar tum ne Allah ki hamd ki ho."
"937","Muhammad bin Salaam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Makhlad ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Juraij ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Najih ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne Mujahid se riwayat kiya ke unhon ne use ye kehte hue suna: Abdullah bin Umar ke ek bete ko chheenk aayi, ya Abu Bakr tha ya Umar tha, to us ne kaha: aabb, to Ibn Umar ne farmaya: aabb kya hai, beshak aabb shaitanon mein se ek shaitan ka naam hai jis ne ise chheenk aur hamd ke darmiyan daal diya hai."
"938","Abu al Waleed ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ikrima bin Ammar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Iyas bin Salama ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas tha, pas ek shakhs ko chheenk aayi to unhon ne kaha: Allah tum par reham kare, phir us ne doosri martaba chheenk maari to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: ye zukam wala hai."
"939","Qutaiba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne Ibn Ajlaan se, unhon ne Maqburi se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: use ek baar aur do baar aur teen baar chheenk ka jawab do, pas jo is ke baad ho woh zukam hai."
"940","Muhammad bin Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne Hakeem bin Dailam se, unhon ne Abu Burda se, unhon ne Abu Musa se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahood Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke saamne jaan boojh kar chheenkte the is ummeed par ke woh un se kahenge: Allah tum par reham kare, pas woh farmate the: Allah tumhein hidayat de aur tumhara haal durust farmaye. Abu Hafs bin Ali ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hakeem bin Dailam ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Burda ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne apne walid se isi tarah riwayat kiya."
"941","Farwa aur Ahmad bin Ishkaab ne hum se bayan kiya, un dono ne kaha: Qasim bin Malik Muzani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Aasim bin Kulaib se, unhon ne Abu Burda se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: main Abu Musa ke paas gaya jabke woh apni beti Umm al Fazl bint al Abbas ke ghar mein the, pas mujhe chheenk aayi to unhon ne mujhe chheenk ka jawab na diya, aur un ko chheenk aayi to unhon ne use chheenk ka jawab diya, pas main ne apni walida ko khabar di, phir jab woh un ke paas aayeen to un par khafa huin aur kaha: mere bete ko chheenk aayi to tum ne use chheenk ka jawab na diya, aur un ko chheenk aayi to tum ne use jawab diya, to unhon ne un se kaha: beshak main ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: jab tum mein se koi chheenke phir Allah ki hamd kare to use chheenk ka jawab do, aur agar woh Allah ki hamd na kare to use jawab na do, aur beshak tumhare bete ko chheenk aayi to us ne Allah ki hamd na ki, pas main ne use jawab na diya, aur un ko chheenk aayi to us ne Allah ki hamd ki, pas main ne use jawab diya, to unhon ne kaha: tum ne acha kiya."
"942","Abdullah bin Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne humein khabar di, unhon ne Ala bin Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat kiya, Aap ne farmaya: jab tum mein se koi jamahi le to jitna ho sake use roke."
"943","Musa bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Qatada se, unhon ne Anas se, unhon ne Muaz se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke peeche sawaar tha, pas Aap ne farmaya: aye Muaz, main ne kaha: labbaik wa saadaik, phir Aap ne isi tarah teen martaba farmaya: kya tum jante ho bandon par Allah ka kya haq hai, main ne kaha: nahin, Aap ne farmaya: ke woh Us ki ibadat karein aur Us ke saath kisi cheez ko shareek na karein, phir Aap kuchh der chalte rahe phir farmaya: aye Muaz, main ne kaha: labbaik wa saadaik, Aap ne farmaya: kya tum jante ho jab woh aisa karein to Allah Azza wa Jalla par bandon ka kya haq hai, ye ke woh unhein azaab na de."
"944","Abdullah bin Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Lais ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Uqail ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman bin Abdullah bin Kaab bin Malik ne mujhe khabar di ke Abdullah bin Kaab ne kaha, aur woh apne beton mein se Kaab ke rehnuma the jab woh nabina ho gaye the, unhon ne kaha: main ne Kaab bin Malik ko apna qissa bayan karte hue suna jab woh Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se Tabuk ki ghazwa mein peeche reh gaye the, pas Allah ne un ki tauba qabool farmayi, aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Fajr ki namaz padhi to ham par Allah ki tauba ki khabar di, pas log fauj dar fauj mujh se milne aaye, mujhe tauba ki mubarakbad dete hue kehte the: tumhein Allah ki tauba mubarak ho, yahan tak ke main masjid mein dakhil hua to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke ird gird log the, pas Talha bin Ubaidullah meri taraf daudte hue uthe, yahan tak ke unhon ne mujh se musafaha kiya aur mujhe mubarakbad di, Allah ki qasam Muhajireen mein se un ke siwa koi shakhs meri taraf na utha, main Talha ki ye baat kabhi na bhoolunga."
"945","Muhammad bin Arara ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Saad bin Ibrahim se, unhon ne Abu Umama bin Sahl bin Hunaif se, unhon ne Abu Said Khudri se riwayat kiya ke kuchh log Saad bin Muaz ke faisle par utre, pas unhon ne un ki taraf qasid bheja, to woh gadhe par sawaar ho kar aaye, phir jab woh masjid ke qareeb pahunche to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: apne behtareen shakhs ya apne sardar ki taraf utho, pas unhon ne farmaya: aye Saad beshak ye log tumhare faisle par utre hain, to Saad ne kaha: main un ke baare mein faisla karta hun ke un ke jangju qatl kiye jayein aur un ki aulaad qaid ki jaye, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: tum ne Allah ke hukm ke muwafiq faisla kiya, ya farmaya: tum ne Badshah ke hukm ke muwafiq faisla kiya."
"946","Musa bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Humaid se, unhon ne Anas se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se zyada dekhne mein koi shakhs unhein mehboob na tha, aur jab woh Aap ko dekhte to Aap ki taraf khade na hote the, is wajah se jo woh Aap ki is baat se nafrat ko jante the."
"947","Muhammad bin al Hakam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nadr ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Israil ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maisara bin Habib ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Minhal bin Amr ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Ayesha bint Talha ne bayan kiya, Ummul Momineen Hazrat Ayesha raziyallahu anha se, unhon ne farmaya: maine logon me se kisi ko Fatima se barh kar guftagu me aur baat cheet me aur nashist me Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se zyada mushabeh nahi dekha, unhon ne farmaya: aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab unhein aati hui dekhte to unhein khush aamdeed kehte, phir un ki taraf khare hote pas un ka bosa lete, phir un ka haath pakarte pas unhein la kar apni jagah bithate, aur jab Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam un ke paas tashreef late to woh Aap ko khush aamdeed kehtin, phir Aap ki taraf khari hotin pas Aap ka bosa letin, aur woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas Aap ke us marz me dakhil huin jis me Aap ki wafaat hui, to Aap ne unhein khush aamdeed kaha aur un ka bosa liya, aur un se sargoshi ki to woh ro padein, phir un se sargoshi ki to woh hans padein, to maine aurton se kaha: main to samajhti thi ke is khatoon ko aurton par fazeelat hasil hai, to woh bhi aurton hi me se hain, kabhi woh ro rahi hain aur achanak woh hans rahi hain, pas maine un se poocha: unhon ne tum se kya farmaya, unhon ne kaha: agar aisa hai to main to raaz phailane wali ban jaungi, phir jab Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki wafaat ho gayi to unhon ne farmaya: unhon ne mujh se sargoshi ki pas farmaya: main faut hone wala hun, to main ro padi, phir unhon ne mujh se sargoshi ki pas farmaya: tum mere ghar walon me se mujh se sab se pehle milne wali ho, to main is se khush hui aur mujhe acha laga."
"948","Abdullah bin Saleh ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Lais ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Zubair ne mujh se bayan kiya, Jabir se, unhon ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam beemar hue, to hum ne Aap ke peeche namaz parhi jabke Aap baithe hue the, aur Abu Bakr logon ko Aap ki takbeer suna rahe the, to Aap ne hamari taraf tawajjuh farmai pas hamein khara hua dekha, to hamari taraf ishara farmaya pas hum baith gaye, pas hum ne Aap ki namaz ke sath baith kar namaz parhi, phir jab Aap ne salam phera to farmaya: qareeb tha ke tum Faris aur Room walon jaisa kaam karte, woh apne badshahon ke samne khare rehte hain jabke woh baithe hote hain, pas aisa na karo, apne imamon ki pairwi karo, agar woh khara ho kar namaz parhe to tum khare ho kar namaz parho, aur agar woh baith kar namaz parhe to tum baith kar namaz parho."
"949","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Suhail ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Saeed se, Abu Saeed se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: jab tum me se koi jamahi le to apna haath apne munh par rakhe, kyunke shaitan is me dakhil hota hai."
"950","Usman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, Mansur se, Hilal bin Yasaf se, Ata se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne farmaya: jab jamahi aaye to apna haath apne munh par rakhe, kyunke ye to shaitan ki taraf se hai."
"951","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bishr bin al Mufaddal ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Suhail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: maine Abu Saeed Khudri ke ek bete ko apne walid se apne walid se bayan karte hue suna, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: jab tum me se koi jamahi le to apne munh ko thaame rakhe, kyunke shaitan is me dakhil hota hai. Khalid bin Makhlad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Suhail ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Abdur Rahman bin Abi Saeed ne bayan kiya, apne walid se, ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: jab tum me se koi jamahi le to apne haath se apna munh pakre, kyunke shaitan is me dakhil hota hai."
"952","Abdullah bin Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ishaq bin Abi Talha se, ke unhon ne Anas bin Malik ko kehte hue suna: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam Umm Haram bint Milhan ke paas tashreef le jate the, to woh Aap ko khana khilatin, aur woh Ubada bin Samit ke nikah me thin, pas unhon ne Aap ko khana khilaya aur Aap ke sar me se juen nikalne lagin, pas Aap so gaye phir hanste hue bedar hue."
"953","Ali bin Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mughira bin Salama Abu Hisham al Makhzumi ne hum se bayan kiya, aur woh siqa the, unhon ne kaha: Saq bin Hazn ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Qasim bin Mutayyib ne bayan kiya, Hasan Basri se, Qais bin Asim al Sadi se, unhon ne kaha: main Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aaya to Aap ne farmaya: ye ujad dehatiyon ke sardar hain, to maine arz kiya: Ya Rasoolullah, woh kaun sa maal hai jis me mujh par kisi talabgaar ki taraf se ya kisi mehmaan ki taraf se koi zimmedari nahi, to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: behtareen maal chaalees hai, aur zyada se zyada saath hai, aur saikron walon ke liye halakat hai magar jo qeemti cheez de, aur doodh wali oontni doodh peene ke liye de, aur moti oontni zibah kare, pas khud khaye aur qanaat karne wale aur sawal karke aane wale ko khilaye, maine arz kiya: Ya Rasoolullah, ye akhlaq kitne izzat wale hain, mere maweshiyon ki kasrat ki wajah se jis waadi me main hun us me thaharna mumkin nahi, to Aap ne farmaya: atiye ke sath kya karte ho, maine kaha: main jawan oont deta hun, aur buddhi oontni deta hun, Aap ne farmaya: maniha me kya karte ho, unhon ne farmaya: main oontni doodh ke liye deta hun, Aap ne farmaya: tarooqa me kya karte ho, unhon ne kaha: log subah apni rasiyon ke sath nikalte hain, aur kisi shakhs ko kisi oont se nahi roka jata ke woh us ki nakel pakar le, pas use jab tak chahe roke rakhe, yahan tak ke wohi use wapas kare, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: tumhein apna maal zyada mehboob hai ya tumhare mawalon ka maal, unhon ne kaha: mera maal, Aap ne farmaya: tumhein apne maal me se to bas wohi hai jo tum ne kha kar fana kar diya, ya de kar aage bhej diya, aur baqi tumhare mawalon ke liye hai, to maine kaha: beshak, agar main wapas gaya to zaroor in ki tadaad kam kar dunga, phir jab un ki maut ka waqt aaya to unhon ne apne beton ko jama kiya pas farmaya: aye mere beto, mujh se le lo, kyunke tum mujh se badh kar apna khairkhwah kisi se nahi loge: mujh par noha na karna, kyunke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam par noha nahi kiya gaya, aur maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko noha se mana karte hue suna hai, aur mujhe mere unhi kapron me kafan dena jin me main namaz parhta tha, aur apne baron ko sardar banao, kyunke jab tum apne baron ko sardar banaoge to tum me tumhare baap ka janashin hamesha baqi rahega, aur jab tum apne chhoton ko sardar banaoge to tumhare bare logon ki nazar me haqeer ho jayenge, aur woh tum se be raghbat ho jayenge, aur apni guzran durust rakho, kyunke is me logon se mangne se be niyazi hai, aur mangne se bacho, kyunke ye aadmi ki aakhri kamai hai, aur jab tum mujhe dafan karo to meri qabr barabar kar dena, kyunke mere aur Bakr bin Wail ke is qabile ke darmiyan kuch kharashen hoti rahi hain, pas mujhe khatra hai ke koi bewaqoof aisa kaam kare jo tumhare deen me tum par aib dakhil kar de."
"954","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Abul Aaliya se, unhon ne kaha: maine Abdullah bin Samit se poocha, unhon ne kaha: maine apne jigar dost Abu Zar se poocha, to unhon ne farmaya: main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas wuzu ka pani laya, to Aap ne apna sar harkat di, aur apne honton ko daanton se dabaya, maine arz kiya: mere maa baap Aap par qurban, kya maine Aap ko takleef di, Aap ne farmaya: nahi, lekin tum aise hukmaranon ya imamon ko paoge jo namaz ko us ke waqt se muakkhar karenge, maine arz kiya: to Aap mujhe kya hukm dete hain, Aap ne farmaya: namaz ko us ke waqt par parho, phir agar tum un ke sath pao to use bhi parho, aur hargiz ye na kehna: maine namaz parh li hai, pas main namaz nahi parhunga."
"955","Yahya bin Bukair ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Lais ne hum se bayan kiya, Uqail se, Ibn Shihab se, Ali bin Husain se, ke Husain bin Ali ne unhein bayan kiya, Hazrat Ali raziyallahu anhu se, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam raat ko un ke paas aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki beti Fatima ke paas tashreef laye, pas farmaya: kya tum namaz nahi parhte, to maine arz kiya: Ya Rasoolullah, hamari jaanein to Allah ke paas hain, pas jab woh chahega ke hamein uthaye to hamein utha dega, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam wapas tashreef le gaye, aur mujhe koi jawab na diya, phir maine suna jabke Aap peeth pher kar ja rahe the, apni raan par haath marte hue farma rahe the: aur insan har cheez se barh kar jhagre wala hai."
